{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06925","headline":"第三峰 · 常建","name":"第三峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西山第三顶，茅宇依双松。\n杳杳欲至天，云梯升几重。\n莹魄澄玉虚，以求鸾鹤踪。\n逶迤非天人，执节乘赤龙。\n旁映白日光，缥缈轻霞容。\n孤辉上烟雾，余影明心胸。\n愿与黄麒麟，欲飞而莫从。\n因寂清万象，轻云自中峰。\n山暝学栖鸟，月来随暗蛬。\n寻空静余响，嫋嫋云溪钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}